@VenuePulse.AccessControl.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5199

### Zonas de un evento (aforo)
GET {{VenuePulse.AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/zones?eventId={{eventId}}
Accept: application/json

### Ocupación de una zona concreta
GET {{VenuePulse.AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/zones/{{zoneId}}/occupancy
Accept: application/json

### Predicción de ocupación de un evento
GET {{VenuePulse.AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/prediction/events/{{eventId}}?eventStartsAtUtc=2026-09-01T20:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

### Arrancar simulación (Ventas o Arrivals)
POST {{VenuePulse.AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/simulation/events/{{eventId}}/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "Sales",
  "eventStartsAtUtc": "2026-09-01T20:00:00Z",
  "durationSeconds": 20,
  "targetSoldPct": 0.85,
  "noShowPct": 0.08
}

### Parar simulación
POST {{VenuePulse.AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/simulation/events/{{eventId}}/stop

### Estado de la simulación
GET {{VenuePulse.AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/simulation/events/{{eventId}}/status
Accept: application/json

### Reiniciar simulación
POST {{VenuePulse.AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/simulation/events/{{eventId}}/reset

###
